  "description": "Computer programer Donny has it all—a great job, wonderful girlfriend, money in the bank and his dog Rover—he’s just the best. Such a good boy. However, when all of this is suddenly taken away, Donny soon finds himself in over his head when a mysterious anomaly threatens the destruction of the universe as he knows it. To discover the cause, Donny joins a ragtag group of misfit adventurers led by the fiercely independent and way out of his league fortune seeker, Lydia Grates. Will Donny and his new friends save themselves before an apocalyptic anomaly tears the universe apart? Find out in this exciting and hilarious 10 episode audio series. First episode drops August 19th.",
